Upstream ggml-org/llama.cpp 119f68d7d (#30505, "ggml-cpu : select the NEON fp32->fp16 conversion"), MIT.
The NEON branch defined GGML_CPU_COMPUTE_FP32_TO_FP16 but never selected it, so fp32 -> fp16 on aarch64 used the
portable software conversion. Same results except NaN payloads.

